  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">這個模組將貓頭鷹加入了遊戲中！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">它們會在森林生態域生成。（在 Forge 中，你可以透過編輯 data -&gt; biome tags 與 biome modifier 資料夾中的 JSON 檔案來修改此設定及其他生成條件；而在 Fabric 中則提供相對應的設定檔）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">它們的行為模式與鸚鵡相同。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">因此你可以用種子以相同的方式馴服牠們（自 1.21.5 版本起，需改用肉類進行馴服）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">並讓牠們在唱機旁盡情狂歡。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">牠們也能站在你的肩膀上休息片刻，並擁有兩種變體。（依寒冷／溫暖生態域區分）</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">模組目前支援</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Forge&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 26.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.12.5 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1 | 1.20.1 | 1.19.2</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Fabric&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;26.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.5 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1 | 1.20.1</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>NeoForge 26.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1184/731/logo.jpg\" width=\"777\" height=\"777\"></em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f60\"><strong>如果你需要其他版本的模組，或在 CurseForge 上遇到任何錯誤，請發送私人訊息給我</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f60\"><a style=\"color:#f60\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#00f\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#00f\"><strong>在 X (Twitter) 上追蹤我</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://x.com/Aquarius_playz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://x.com/Aquarius_playz</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1577/494/639022024300181764.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\"><a style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>此模組需要安裝 AQUARIUSLIBS</strong></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
